{:theorem
 {:id :theorem,
  :statement
  "Under conjugation by the Hadamard gate $H$: $H X H^\\dagger = Z$, $H Y H^\\dagger = -Y$, $H Z H^\\dagger = X$. Consequently, for $Z_S = \\bigotimes_{i \\in S} Z_i \\otimes \\bigotimes_{i \\notin S} I_i$, we have $H^{\\otimes n} Z_S (H^{\\otimes n})^\\dagger = X_S$.",
  :content-hash "ec7e6353db04ae00"},
 :obligations [],
 :archived-nodes {},
 :external-refs {},
 :nodes
 {:1-h2a001
  {:statement
   "The Hadamard gate is defined as $H = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{pmatrix}$. Note that $H^\\dagger = H$ (Hermitian) and $H^2 = I$ (involutory).",
   :taint :clean,
   :parent nil,
   :content-hash "c0d03f2eaac70884",
   :display-order 1,
   :type :definition,
   :scope #{},
   :justification :definition-expansion,
   :status :verified,
   :id :1-h2a001,
   :provenance
   {:created-at "2026-01-06T18:00:00Z",
    :created-by :prover,
    :round 1,
    :revision-of nil},
   :depth 1,
   :dependencies #{}},
  :1-h2a002
  {:statement
   "$H X H^\\dagger = Z$: Computing directly, $H X H = \\frac{1}{2} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{pmatrix} = \\frac{1}{2} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\end{pmatrix} = \\frac{1}{2} \\begin{pmatrix} 2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -2 \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 \\end{pmatrix} = Z$.",
   :taint :clean,
   :parent nil,
   :content-hash "0305ba05a1bfd628",
   :display-order 2,
   :type :claim,
   :scope #{},
   :justification :algebraic-rewrite,
   :status :verified,
   :id :1-h2a002,
   :provenance
   {:created-at "2026-01-06T18:00:00Z",
    :created-by :prover,
    :round 1,
    :revision-of nil},
   :depth 1,
   :dependencies #{:1-h2a001}},
  :1-h2a003
  {:statement
   "$H Y H^\\dagger = -Y$: Computing $H Y H = \\frac{1}{2} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & -i \\\\ i & 0 \\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{pmatrix} = \\frac{1}{2} \\begin{pmatrix} i & -i \\\\ -i & -i \\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{pmatrix} = \\frac{1}{2} \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & 2i \\\\ -2i & 0 \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & i \\\\ -i & 0 \\end{pmatrix} = -Y$.",
   :taint :clean,
   :parent nil,
   :content-hash "8805ea9e6316669e",
   :display-order 3,
   :type :claim,
   :scope #{},
   :justification :algebraic-rewrite,
   :status :verified,
   :id :1-h2a003,
   :provenance
   {:created-at "2026-01-06T18:00:00Z",
    :created-by :prover,
    :round 1,
    :revision-of nil},
   :depth 1,
   :dependencies #{:1-h2a001}},
  :1-h2a004
  {:statement
   "$H Z H^\\dagger = X$: Computing $H Z H = \\frac{1}{2} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 \\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{pmatrix} = \\frac{1}{2} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\end{pmatrix} \\begin{pmatrix} 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -1 \\end{pmatrix} = \\frac{1}{2} \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 0 \\end{pmatrix} = \\begin{pmatrix} 0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 \\end{pmatrix} = X$.",
   :taint :clean,
   :parent nil,
   :content-hash "f356de65198f0679",
   :display-order 4,
   :type :claim,
   :scope #{},
   :justification :algebraic-rewrite,
   :status :verified,
   :id :1-h2a004,
   :provenance
   {:created-at "2026-01-06T18:00:00Z",
    :created-by :prover,
    :round 1,
    :revision-of nil},
   :depth 1,
   :dependencies #{:1-h2a001}},
  :1-h2a005
  {:statement "Also note $H I H^\\dagger = I$ since $H^2 = I$.",
   :taint :clean,
   :parent nil,
   :content-hash "2761aac53d18aad3",
   :display-order 5,
   :type :claim,
   :scope #{},
   :justification :algebraic-rewrite,
   :status :verified,
   :id :1-h2a005,
   :provenance
   {:created-at "2026-01-06T18:00:00Z",
