   :dependencies #{:1-h2a001}},
  :1-h2a006
  {:statement
   "For $Z_S = \\bigotimes_{i \\in S} Z_i \\otimes \\bigotimes_{i \\notin S} I_i$, using the tensor product property $(A \\otimes B)(C \\otimes D) = (AC) \\otimes (BD)$ and $(A \\otimes B)^\\dagger = A^\\dagger \\otimes B^\\dagger$, we have $H^{\\otimes n} Z_S (H^{\\otimes n})^\\dagger = \\bigotimes_{i=1}^n H P_i H^\\dagger$ where $P_i = Z$ for $i \\in S$ and $P_i = I$ for $i \\notin S$.",
   :taint :clean,
   :parent nil,
   :content-hash "b2726f2d08e05d91",
   :display-order 6,
   :type :claim,
   :scope #{},
   :justification :algebraic-rewrite,
   :status :verified,
   :id :1-h2a006,
   :provenance
   {:created-at "2026-01-06T18:00:00Z",
    :created-by :prover,
    :round 1,
    :revision-of nil},
   :depth 1,
   :dependencies #{:1-h2a001}},
  :1-h2a007
  {:statement
   "Therefore $H^{\\otimes n} Z_S (H^{\\otimes n})^\\dagger = \\bigotimes_{i \\in S} (H Z H^\\dagger) \\otimes \\bigotimes_{i \\notin S} (H I H^\\dagger) = \\bigotimes_{i \\in S} X_i \\otimes \\bigotimes_{i \\notin S} I_i = X_S$. QED.",
   :taint :clean,
   :parent nil,
   :content-hash "730591a5948a9a74",
   :display-order 7,
